     "t": "Roots beginning with a vowel"
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "For a root that begins with a **vowel**, attach -um- straight to the **front** of the root, like a prefix."
    },
    {
     "type": "table",
     "head": [
      "Form",
      "Verb",
