       "will leave"
      ]
     ],
     "title": "Alís (leave)"
    },
    {
     "type": "h",
     "t": "Roots beginning with a consonant"
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "For a root that begins with a **consonant**, put -um- **inside** the root, right **after the first consonant**."
    },
    {
