    {
     "type": "box",
     "kind": "remember",
     "title": "Remember",
     "items": [
      "-Um- and mag- verbs focus on the doer; the verb usually comes first.",
      "-Um-: in front of a vowel root (umalís), after the first consonant otherwise (kumain).",
      "Mag-: mag- + hyphen before a vowel (mag-áral); past and present change to nag-.",
      "Present repeats the first syllable: umaalís, kumakain, nag-aáral, naglulutò. Future: aalís, kakain, mag-aáral, maglulutò.",
      "Pattern 1: verb + doer + object. Pattern 2: verb + object + doer. Use pattern 1 with siyá and silá."
     ]
    },
